:name: HawkHealth Group (STM32F767)
:description: Run the group build in Renode and watch its output on USART3.
#
# Use this one if you launch Renode from somewhere other than your clone root.
# EDIT the two absolute paths for YOUR machine (forward slashes, no quotes):
#   1) the platform file in your clone:  <clone>/platforms/hawkhealth_f767.repl
#   2) the firmware you built or downloaded:  <path>/hawkhealth.elf
#
using sysbus
mach create "hawkhealth"
machine LoadPlatformDescription @C:/Users/you/CENG4200/fall_2026_hawk_health_group_repo/platforms/hawkhealth_f767.repl
sysbus LoadELF @C:/Users/you/CENG4200/fall_2026_hawk_health_group_repo/firmware/hawkhealth.elf
showAnalyzer sysbus.usart3
#
# then, at the (hawkhealth) monitor prompt:  start
